    "name": "ADP Payroll API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The ADP Payroll API provides programmatic access to payroll processing, payroll output data, and compensation management. REST APIs support payroll runs, payroll output retrieval (including CSV-formatted bulk data), and headcount and compensation analysis across ADP payroll platforms.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ADP Developer Resources",
